<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Merrill names Ericsson focus stock.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Merrill names Ericsson focus stock.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said it upgraded Telefon AB L.M. Ericsson to near-term buy from accumulate and named the Swedish telecom equipment supplier as its Focus Stock of the Week.</p>
<p>-- The brokerage said it maintained its long-term buy rating on Ericsson.</p>
<p>-- The analyst was not immediately available to comment.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street bureau, 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
